    {
      "id": "DtpA8Psx2xphgih_tvrt-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2403.875103097994,
      "y": -3944.0791283046538,
      "width": 1585.078857421875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 853180620,
      "version": 1082,
      "versionNonce": 353842380,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794869258567,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Patterns :\n\n1) Build Agents inside System of Recrod ( e.g agents inside, salesforce,  agent inside service now) . but it will not provide holistic view, lot of custom integration \n2) Centralized everythign into a Warehouse or lake. (  Agents are current as last batch and when was the last batch loaded, no absoluted freshness)\n3) Query Open Tables ( TableFlow directly ) - 1min to 15 min`\n4) Federate throu API layer. MCP gateway ( operational overhead or operational nightmare, heavy token cost)\n\nAgents need data which is absolutedly current, which is one view of business  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Patterns :\n\n1) Build Agents inside System of Recrod ( e.g agents inside, salesforce,  agent inside service now) . but it will not provide holistic view, lot of custom integration \n2) Centralized everythign into a Warehouse or lake. (  Agents are current as last batch and when was the last batch loaded, no absoluted freshness)\n3) Query Open Tables ( TableFlow directly ) - 1min to 15 min`\n4) Federate throu API layer. MCP gateway ( operational overhead or operational nightmare, heavy token cost)\n\nAgents need data which is absolutedly current, which is one view of business  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
