      "updated": 1794874445804,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-  STreamhouse: New category or Architecture style & not a product\n-  A data architecture that continuously captures, processes, governs and serves the current state of\nthe business to applications, AI agents and analytics, so they all use the same fresh, trusted source\nof truth\n-  DIY: 5 or 6 deisparate platforms, no unified security model or end to end lineage\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "Xx1KcyTDOoYgmz9kVBymt",
      "originalText": "-  STreamhouse: New category or Architecture style & not a product\n-  A data architecture that continuously captures, processes, governs and serves the current state of the business to applications, AI agents and analytics, so they all use the same fresh, trusted source of truth\n-  DIY: 5 or 6 deisparate platforms, no unified security model or end to end lineage\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
