      "updated": 1794874445804,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Traditional Architecture Drawbacks ( For agents & real-time apps)\n- Data is Stale by Default\n- Seperate Copies of data and hence multiple sources of truth\n- Infrastructure is batch and isn't build for the operational critical path",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "utyFkLwyLYgXl2lizIPG-",
      "originalText": "Traditional Architecture Drawbacks ( For agents & real-time apps)\n- Data is Stale by Default\n- Seperate Copies of data and hence multiple sources of truth\n- Infrastructure is batch and isn't build for the operational critical path",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
